  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "scene.story.liu_bang.pei_county_opening",
      "name": "沛县清晨",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "background",
          "backgroundId": "bg.pei_county.office"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "沛县晨雾未散，县署前的木牌还沾着露水。催役的文书压在案上，乡里豪杰的请托也已经递到了门口。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char.xiao_he",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "季兄，县中差役不能再拖。秦法催得紧，可乡里人心也不能一味逼迫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char.liu_bang",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "法令要应，人也要留。先把最急的事办了，别让沛县今日就乱起来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "刘邦今日先处理哪一头？",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "liu-opening-duty",
              "label": "先办县中差役",
              "nextSceneId": "scene.story.liu_bang.first_duty",
              "effects": [
                {
                  "type": "change-variable",
                  "key": "var.story.liu_bang.local_reputation",
                  "delta": 1
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "liu-opening-heroes",
              "label": "先会乡里故人",
              "nextSceneId": "scene.story.liu_bang.first_heroes",
              "effects": [
                {
                  "type": "set-flag",
                  "key": "flag.story.liu_bang.met_local_heroes",
                  "value": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scene.story.liu_bang.first_duty",
      "name": "县中差役",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "start-activity",
          "activityId": "activity.liu_bang.pei_county.default_errand"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你翻开案上簿册，把催役名目、乡里担保和上官限期一一重新排定。杂务虽小，却先稳住了县署今日的阵脚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char.xiao_he",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "先把簿册理顺，后面无论押送、催役还是应付上官，都有回旋余地。"
        },
        {
          "type": "effect",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set-flag",
              "key": "flag.story.liu_bang.opening.completed",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "沛县的一日就这样压了下来。你已在县署与乡里之间立住第一步，后续流程将继续由 JSON 开局包扩展。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scene.story.liu_bang.first_heroes",
      "name": "乡里故人",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "characterId": "char.lu_wan",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "季哥，酒肆里都在说外头徭役越发紧了。你若要人帮忙，得先让大家知道你心里有数。"
        },
        {
          "type": "start-activity",
          "activityId": "activity.liu_bang.pei_county.default_errand"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你借着乡里故人的消息，把几桩棘手杂务拆给可信的人手。县中差役未必轻松，但人情脉络已经动了起来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "effect",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set-flag",
              "key": "flag.story.liu_bang.opening.completed",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "卢绾带着话头离去，酒肆与里巷很快会知道你今日的安排。后续流程将继续由 JSON 开局包扩展。"
        }
      ]
    }
